{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e15-scene-18",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "全员待命迎决赛  (All Hands Ready for the Finale)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Chun Yuqiao steps into the Chief Editor's Office with his medicine bag to run through final checks for tomorrow night's Twelve Singers finale. Listen to their rapid-fire Mandarin briefing.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，你这次怎么拿了这么多药啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没事，我试试新药。明天晚上就是决赛直播了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "电视台同步了全流程，三组导演就位，二部作为后备团队全员待命。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那艺人那边呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "艺人全部回复确认通告时间，所有签约歌手已经入住选手村集体待命。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "四位助演嘉宾已经和乐队敲定了曲目，完成了走台，背景调查也全清。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那应急预案和天气呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "两套应急预案都已经没有问题，全员培训考核通过。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "天气预报说是蓝色预警，我觉得这雨应该下不起来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "卫星频道已经确认，所有的转播车都已经检修完毕，报告已回收。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "制作一部全员已经登入指挥系统，从九点开始七十二小时不间断在线。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我和杏子姐还有凯文哥都已经安排好时间表了，确保昼夜都有人知情。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你不就想问这些吗？全搞定了，全确认了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，你这次怎么拿了这么多药啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yuqiao, why did you bring so much medicine this time?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没事，我试试新药。明天晚上就是决赛直播了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is nothing, just trying new medicine; tomorrow night is the live finale.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "电视台同步了全流程，三组导演就位，二部作为后备团队全员待命。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The station synced the full rundown, three director teams are in position, and Unit Two is standing by as backup.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那艺人那边呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what about the artists?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "艺人全部回复确认通告时间，所有签约歌手已经入住选手村集体待命。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All artists confirmed their call times, and every signed singer has checked into the contestant village on standby.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "四位助演嘉宾已经和乐队敲定了曲目，完成了走台，背景调查也全清。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The four guest performers finalised songs with the band, finished stage blocking, and cleared all background checks.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那应急预案和天气呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What about emergency contingencies and the weather?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "两套应急预案都已经没有问题，全员培训考核通过。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Both emergency plans are ready with zero issues, and the whole crew passed training checks.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "天气预报说是蓝色预警，我觉得这雨应该下不起来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The weather forecast shows a blue alert, so I doubt heavy rain will actually build up.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "卫星频道已经确认，所有的转播车都已经检修完毕，报告已回收。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The satellite feed is confirmed, every broadcast truck has been inspected, and the reports are back.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "制作一部全员已经登入指挥系统，从九点开始七十二小时不间断在线。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All of Unit One has logged into the command system, staying online non-stop for seventy-two hours from nine o'clock.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我和杏子姐还有凯文哥都已经安排好时间表了，确保昼夜都有人知情。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi, Kaiwen, and I have set the shift schedule so someone stays informed day and night.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你不就想问这些吗？全搞定了，全确认了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Were those not the exact questions on your mind? Everything is settled and confirmed!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，你这次怎么拿了这么多药啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没事，我试试新药。明天晚上就是决赛直播了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "电视台同步了全流程，三组导演就位，二部作为后备团队全员待命。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那艺人那边呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "艺人全部回复确认通告时间，所有签约歌手已经入住选手村集体待命。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "四位助演嘉宾已经和乐队敲定了曲目，完成了走台，背景调查也全清。",
      "gap": 0.5
